{pos 4}{color 3}Ask doctor to let me quit being
in charge of that patient.

It's too weird.{end}

strings.map7_s02.told_the_doctor_i_quit:
{pos 4}{color 3}Told the doctor I quit.
Won't work at that
hospital anymore.{end}

strings.map7_s02.then_the_pathway_opens:
{color 3}Then, the pathway opens
Awaiting them, the frenzied
Uproar, the feast of death!{end}

strings.map7_s02.there_are_specimen_of:
There are specimen of
butterflies and moths
hanging on the wall.{end}

strings.map7_s02.there_are_old_fairy_tales:
There are old fairy tales,
picture books of animals,
and plants on the shelf.{end}

strings.map7_s02.theres_a_bottle_filled_with:
There's a bottle filled
with some kind of drug.
Better leave it.{end}

strings.map7_s02.theres_a_botanical_reference:
There's a botanical
reference book.
Don't need to read it now.{end}
